    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83146.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "Today, news you can trust feels like a rarity. That's why the Daily Signal Podcast releases a top news edition every weekday at 5 p.m. Whether driving home from work, fixing dinner, or picking the kids up from soccer practice, you can stay informed on the headlines you care about. Every show is quick and succinct, designed to keep you up to speed on the issues that actually matter. Catch our top news edition right here in your daily signal podcast feed every evening, or listen first thing in the morning before catching the days interview. And be sure to subscribe on the daily signal podcast so you never miss an episode.",
