    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "This is the most important election of our lives because of what is at stake. When we look at the brazen abuse of power that's occurring, under the Biden-Harris administration, it challenges not only the fact that they are trying to take down President Biden's opponent, Donald Trump, but how they are undermining the rule of law and weaponizing these institutions against people who disagree with them or who challenge their authority. It is our freedom and our democracy that's on the line in this election. And it's why all of us as Americans need to recognize that. make sure that we vote on November 5th, send President Biden and Kamala Harris home and elect Donald Trump to the White House.",
