    "turn_text": "Yeah, I just learned about that yesterday. It's one of, unfortunately, many different examples of how the FBI is being used to go after people, if for no other reason than pure intimidation, and of course, if they follow through on some kind of trumped up charges, this is exactly what we're talking about. How is this any different than a dictatorship and some other part of the world going after political dissidents? We're already seeing it happening. It's not some theory or possibility that it may happen in the future. It's happening right before our very eyes. It's a very dangerous thing, but I am glad that these stories are coming to light and it's important that we shine a light on them because there's a lot of, there's a lot of people who are busy in their lives and they don't pay much attention to politics. So this is one of one of the reasons why I'm just dedicating my time over the next four and a half months, five months until the election speaking the truth, sharing these stories, sharing my own",
